    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>The Archangel · уровень 10</b></p><p>While in your Avatar of the Archangel form you gain Resistance to Psychic damage, and you are Immune to being<br>Charmed or Frightened.<br>Divine Fury. Whenever you succeed on a Wisdom saving throw, you can choose one creature you can see within<br>30 feet. That creature takes Radiant damage equal to 2d8<br>+ your Charisma modifier.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Только в Avatar после успешного Wis save. Защиты формы применяет макрос.</li></ul>"
